.DS_Store
repair_data_gen/reference

!repair_data_gen/reference/two_page_rp.tex

# Candidate pools are regenerable intermediates (build_pool.py) and run to tens
# of MB.  Committing each regeneration would leave a permanent blob per
# iteration in git history.  The scripts and the summarise() stats are the
# reproducible record; the pool itself is not.
repair_data_gen/pool_*.tsv

__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Switchboard-derived tables (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0); rebuild with swbd_flatten.py
repair_data_gen/llm_gen_playground/natural_rsr_check/swbd/

# Raw model responses, one JSON per item (train_full alone is 168 MB).  The
# parsed answers are in results/<model>.<tag>.tsv; run_meta (prompt sha,
# flags) is kept as the provenance record.  Raw files committed before
# 2026-10-10 stay tracked.  Back up locally / on the cluster.
repair_data_gen/llm_gen_playground/results/raw/*/*
!repair_data_gen/llm_gen_playground/results/raw/*/run_meta_*.json
